# | Carlo Gavazzi EM111 — Modbus register map for Omni Console
# | 
# | Source: carlo-gavazzi-em111-em112-et112-modbus.pdf (EM100/ET100 Series V2 Rev.14)
# | - Single-phase DIN-rail energy meter (EM111: direct measurement up to 65A).
# | - INT32: word order LSW->MSW (little-endian) → word_order = "le".
# | - INT16: single word — no word_order.
# | - FC03 and FC04 return identical data.
# | - Scale factors: V*10→0.1  A*1000→0.001  W/VA/var*10→0.1  PF*1000→0.001  Hz*10→0.1  kWh/kvarh*10→0.1
# | - Factory defaults: slave=1, baud=9600, 1 stop bit, no parity.
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Carlo Gavazzi
@model=EM111
@vendor_website=gavazziautomation.com
@description=Single-phase DIN-rail energy meter (direct ≤65A) — V/I/P/Q/S, PF, frequency, imported/exported energy (scaled INT32 LSW-first).
@source=Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST), modbus-library/carlo-gavazzi-em111.toml; Source: carlo-gavazzi-em111-em112-et112-modbus.pdf (EM100/ET100 Series V2 Rev.14). Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation
@byte_order=ABCD
@address_base=0
